    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Contiguous mesh patch that can, but does not have to be integrated into a <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_model" kindref="compound">Model</ref>. The idea is to temporarily store parts of a mesh during rebuilding operations; Size info is used also to keep number information uptodate.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>SKM </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>23/5/21 </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
